{
  "description": "CombFilter with CombModule's memory (25000 samples, rounded up to 32768). Styles 0..5 are feedback style (comb, positive flange, negative flange) x filter style (low/high blend, band spread); 6..9 exercise style / 3 >= 2, which upstream treats as low/high blend. Inputs at the ports: midi_cutoff in semitones (filter cutoff 8..136 plus modulation and keytrack; values below about -31 hit the memory's max-period clamp at 44.1 kHz), transpose = blend transpose 0..84, pass_blend 0..2, resonance 0..1. The delay read is reference-arm.md site A1a.",
  "module": "comb_filter",
  "params": {
    "size": 25000
  },
  "pending": "Parked, not run: these cases miss module_defaults against the fast-math reference while the port is bit-identical to the REF_FAST_MATH=OFF reference (LEDGER, 2026-10-21 M5b PR 2). Awaiting the owner's decision (escalated: nofastmath exact-match allowlist). Loaders read only modules/<area>/*.json, so this directory is inert until the cases move back.",
